e deemed to qualify through statute) to be admitted solely to engage in international trade, along with their families and employees.</p>","updateDate":"2026-02-26T15:27:01Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"To include the Czech Republic in the list of foreign states whose nationals are eligible for admission into the United States as E1 nonimmigrants if United States nationals are treated similarly by the Government of the Czech Republic.","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-18T00:02:19Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-18T00:02:19Z"}
